### 该接口会将服务端之前上传的文件删除，同时将数据库删除并重建。


POST http://111.231.63.161:8085/aisearch/askgraph/select
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from_id": "guest",
  "from_nickname": "guest",
  "content": {
    "schema": "aiask_test_schema123",
    "schema_description": "文档",
    "chat_type": "agent",
    "is_streaming": true
  }
}

